  ],
  reason: "WHY RUST RATHER THAN .dag: wet `gunbc run` is still the v1 interpreter. It cannot call v2.compiler.source_authority module_file or v2.compiler.module_acquisition acquire_closure_of, and it cannot execute gunbc.source_layout layout_tree_directory as a fold. The seed therefore locates module a.b.c at <root(a)>/b/c.dag, BFS-acquires import lines plus dotted authored types, mints the two derived ledger rosters in memory, and hands resolve an index whose source_files are that set. gunbc compile still walks the tree (parse-as-check). layout_tree_directory_literals_match_policy_source is a declared seed copy of the policy file's two tree prefixes and the v2-elision row, not a second layout authority; v2.test.claim.source_layout_lookup already inhabits module_file. WHY ADMITTED AGAINST THE v1 FREEZE: gunbc.v1.v1_maintenance_standing v1_seed_standing admits by PURPOSE — collapsing the whole-tree tokenize on the wet verb the self-host workflows actually run.",
  owning_dissolution_lane: "v1-hand-queue-drain" as RoadmapNodeId,
  trigger: "Delete these declarations when wet `gunbc run` is a native compiler that acquires the entry through v2.compiler.source_authority module_file and v2.compiler.module_acquisition, SUFFICIENT FOR gunbc.machine_intake.mtcollins1_boot_admission, mtcollins1_boot_run and mtcollins1_sol_notice to resolve without v1_compiler.cli_run.demand_acquire or source_layout_lookup. WHAT DOES NOT RETIRE IT: shrinking the seed BFS; an env fallback to resolve_entry_graph; a second hand copy of the layout prefixes.",
  current_boundary: "v1_compiler.cli_run.demand_acquire resolve_entry_graph_demand_acquired is the only resolve `gunbc run` (src/v1/stage0/src/main.rs run_verb) calls. Governed roots dag and src/v2 use source_layout_lookup module_storage_relative. Other --source-root trees are custom_root_module_census (walk that root only). Derived rosters still go through v1_compiler.cli_run.derived_row_roster (separate justification). Controls: unparseable_module_outside_the_closure_does_not_change_resolve, custom_source_root_demand_and_tree_arms_acquire_the_imported_module, and src/v1/stage0/tests/scoped_run_observation.rs scoped_declaration_identity_follows_the_selected_function_node."
}
